{"baseRefName":"main","body":"Complete proof of k603 in the primary source’s nondegenerate nested-confocal-ellipse setting. A per-edge focal antipedal-distance difference equals a fixed coefficient times vertical displacement, so closure makes the two ordinary-distance sums equal for every N. Includes unchanged proof and receipt plus a separate geometry/source audit with an independent unit-normal derivation: 17,364 author and 1,993 independent exact checks. No hyperbolic-caustic extension or individual-sum constancy claimed. Intended claimed_solved 2/5; novelty and human peer review unestablished. Parent coordinates the queue entry.","files":[{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/QUEUE.md","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/PROOF.md","additions":119,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/README.md","additions":5,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/RESEARCH_LOG.md","additions":6,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/SHA256SUMS","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/REVIEW.md","additions":112,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/author_replay/PROOF.md","additions":119,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/author_replay/verification.json","additions":7,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/author_replay/verify.py","additions":40,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/independent_checks.py","additions":96,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/independent_results.json","additions":28,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/review_summary.json","additions":27,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/independent_review/source_verification.json","additions":19,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/prior_imported_report.json","additions":10,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/source_manifest.json","additions":24,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/source_record.json","additions":46,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/verification.json","additions":7,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/5100032/verify.py","additions":40,"deletions":0}],"headRefName":"dot/math-5100032","headRefOid":"3d159f0a00d0bd7ff8d558d6fbc75af5094f7a35","isDraft":true,"number":110,"state":"OPEN","title":"Elliptic billiards: independently reviewed focal antipedal k603 proof","url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/110"}
